OL,3,GNEWSATwo people dead after car hits
OL,4,Alamppost
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have died after a car
OL,7,Fcrashed into a lamppost in Rotherham.
OL,9,FThe crash took place on East Bawtry
OL,10,FRoad just after 18:40 BST on Saturday,
OL,11,Fa South Yorkshire Police spokesperson
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FThe car, a white BMW 3 Series, was
OL,15,Fbelieved to have been travelling with a
OL,16,Fsecond vehicle, a blue BMW 4 Series,
OL,17,Fbefore it left the carriageway heading
OL,18,Ftowards Worrygoose roundabout and
OL,19,Fcrashed.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
